tap menghadirkan perjalanan yang menantang. Setiap lompatan adalah langkah menuju cahaya, setiap kegagalan adalah kesempatan untuk bangkit, dan setiap puncak menyimpan pemandangan yang layak diperjuangkan.\nBiarkan bunga matahari mengingatkanmu untuk selalu mencari terang, kelinci mengajarkan keberanian untuk terus melangkah, dan angsa mengajarkan bahwa ketenangan adalah kekuatan yang sesungguhnya.\n\n🌻 Selamat datang kembali di **LAUFAS OBSTACLE**🌻\nTemukan kedamaian di antara tantangan, dan nikmati setiap perjalanan menuju puncak.\n","path":"/game/119322930777690-laufas-obstacle","slug":"119322930777690-laufas-obstacle","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4e7f880f065c8c8f7bddf0c5202614e5330d9cb2c276067c7b33170e370b7736.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-359e3ab7091b353192af846bbc9266a3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":793332,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T02:09:48.773Z","creator":{"name":"LAU COMMUNITY","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":72019238502909,"name":"Good Retreat","desc":"","path":"/game/72019238502909-good-retreat","slug":"72019238502909-good-retreat","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b40ce34247a79483981bd62e24ccb7e94d07821b7ad19ae2d05101aa7ef1654f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7d8316fdda6fe55657ad3cd56193317c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":40210,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T00:03:02.185Z","creator":{"name":"Estado de São Paulo, SP","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":122692104456105,"name":"Own a Gym","desc":"Run your own Gym. \nBuy Gym Equipment, Stock shelves with supplements, sell gym memberships, set prices as you'd like, take payments, expand and design your store. \nsecurity, janitors and Product licenses are upcoming.\nThanks for playing!\n\nTIPS:\n- Attract more people into your gym with high quality Gym Equipment.\n- Gym members will